  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1St&#xf6;d till en FAO/Sida referensgrupp vid SLU som skall st&#xf6;dja Sida i samarbetet med FAO men ocks&#xe5; analysera FAOs arbete speciellt fr&#xe5;n ett fattigdomsperspektiv. Referensgruppen har en representant i  Consultative group of the HPAI-arbetet vid FAO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to a FAO/Sida Reference group at SLU which should support Sida in the cooperation with FAO but also to assess the FAO work especially from apoverty alleviation view. The reference group has one representative in the Consultative group of the HPAI work at FAO.</narrative>
  </description>
